      "id": 0,
      "kind": "prep",
      "primary_message": "Mince the garlic. Cut the red bell pepper into 1/4- by 2-inch strips. Cut the green bell pepper into 1/4- by 2-inch strips. Crumble the goat cheese into large pieces. Chop the toasted walnuts.",
      "secondary_message": "1 medium clove garlic\n½ red bell pepper\n½ green bell pepper\n113 g goat cheese\n⅔ cup toasted walnuts"
